---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Payment Model | Gilbert"
  description="Task-based payment model for AI evaluation, technical documentation, digital training, and project delivery work."
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-brand-border bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#F8FAFC]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent mb-3">Work With Me</div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-5">
          Task-based work, clearly scoped.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-slate leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-6">
          You should know what you are buying, what it costs, and when payment is due before work starts.
          I price the task and the deliverable, not a vague block of hours.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="mailto:galihgilberto48@gmail.com?subject=Project%20scope%20review" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-navy text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-brand-deep transition-colors shadow-md">
            Request a scope review
          </a>
          <a href="/#hub" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-border text-brand-navy text-sm font-semibold hover:border-brand-accent hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors shadow-sm">
            Back to hub
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-4">
          No public rate card: final fee depends on scope, volume, input quality, and turnaround.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENGAGEMENT MODELS -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-brand-border bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent mb-2">Engagement Models</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-3">Four ways to work together</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slate">
          Choose the structure that fits the task. The written quote confirms the scope, fee, and payment schedule.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-teal mb-2">01 &bull; Fixed-scope task</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">One deliverable, one agreed fee</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Best for a single output: an AI evaluation batch, rubric calibration, SOP, work instruction,
            inspection checklist, technical review, or a small VR/MR module.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Billing: one fixed fee. Payment schedule is stated in the written quote before work begins.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-teal mb-2">02 &bull; Milestone project</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Pay as each stage is accepted</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Best for multi-stage work: a training module from storyboard to device testing, a documentation set,
            or project delivery support with clear checkpoints.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Billing: split by approved milestones. Each stage is reviewed before the next begins.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-teal mb-2">03 &bull; Ongoing QA block</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Recurring review capacity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Best for recurring work: AI response QA, data labeling checks, documentation upkeep,
            or a steady review queue.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Billing: a monthly block agreed in advance, with the expected volume and response time in writing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#F8FAFC] border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-teal mb-2">04 &bull; Discovery / advisory</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Define the task before building</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Best when the scope is unclear: a short working session to map inputs, constraints,
            acceptance criteria, and the smallest useful deliverable.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
            Billing: quoted separately. You receive a written scope before production work starts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TASK CATEGORIES -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 border-b border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent mb-2">Task Categories</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-3">What I scope and quote</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slate">
          Each category can be handled as a fixed-scope task, a milestone project, or an ongoing block.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">AI evaluation &amp; data quality</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
            Response evaluation, comparison and ranking, factual accuracy checks, rubric-based scoring,
            error classification, annotation/labeling QA, and written evaluation notes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Technical documentation</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
            SOPs, work instructions, troubleshooting guides, inspection checklists,
            terminology review, and Indonesian–English technical review.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Digital training</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
            Training needs analysis, storyboard and interaction design, VR/MR module scoping,
            Unity build support, device testing, and training effectiveness review.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Project delivery</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
            Project planning, stakeholder coordination, implementation tracking, status reporting,
            and structured evaluation for manufacturing and digital initiatives.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- QUOTE CONTENTS -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-accent mb-2">Before Work Starts</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight mb-3">Every quote states the same basics</h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-slate mb-8">
        No verbal-only scope. No surprise add-ons. The written quote is the working agreement for the task.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Deliverable &amp; acceptance criteria</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">What is produced, and what “done” means.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Inputs &amp; assumptions</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">What I need from you, and what is excluded.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Revision rounds</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">The number of review passes included in the fee.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Timeline &amp; dependencies</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">Delivery window and anything that can move it.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Fee &amp; payment schedule</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">The amount, currency, and when each payment is due.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-[#F8FAFC] p-4">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">Confidentiality</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1">NDA and handling of sensitive inputs, if needed.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-brand-navy text-white">
        <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-1">Scope changes are re-quoted.</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          If the task changes materially after approval, I pause, explain the impact, and issue a revised scope.
          Work continues only after you approve the change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:galihgilberto48@gmail.com?subject=Project%20scope%20review" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-navy text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-brand-deep transition-colors shadow-md">
          Start with a scope review
        </a>
        <a href="/#case-studies" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-brand-border text-brand-navy text-sm font-semibold hover:border-brand-accent hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors shadow-sm">
          See selected work
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
